      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stuff the cap firmly so it keeps its dome shape. Stuff the stem lightly. Position the open base of the cap over the top of the stem, overlapping by about 1 cm. Sew around the join with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "slip-stitch-join"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "whip stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", making sure the cap overhang is even all the way round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut six 1.5 cm white felt circles for the spots. Tack each one to the cap top with a single stitch at the centre, spacing them evenly. Or embroider them in white using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "half-double-crochet"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "satin stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Weave in all ends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Next up: the amigurumi-acorn is another quick piece, or the amigurumi-snail adds a creature to the set."
